1
00:00:00,923 --> 00:00:04,803
(Leonard:)Okay. Well, once again,
you guys have a good...

2
00:00:04,969 --> 00:00:06,929
(Leonard:)...whatever this is.

3
00:00:09,348 --> 00:00:12,898
(Ramona:)Dr. Cooper, I have to tell you,
your friends are holding you back.

4
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:16,310
(Sheldon:)I prefer to think of it as
I'm pulling them forward.

5
00:00:17,607 --> 00:00:18,647
(Ramona:)Halo night?

6
00:00:18,816 --> 00:00:21,696
(Ramona:)A man with your intellectual gifts
doesn't waste an evening...

7
00:00:21,861 --> 00:00:22,991
(Ramona:)...playing video games.

8
00:00:23,404 --> 00:00:25,494
(Sheldon:)He does on Wednesdays.

9
00:00:25,948 --> 00:00:27,868
(Ramona:)Not if he wants a Nobel Prize.

10
00:00:28,534 --> 00:00:30,704
(Sheldon:)He does want that.

11
00:00:32,789 --> 00:00:36,419
(Sheldon:)Does a man with my intellectual gifts
play paintball on weekends?

12
00:00:36,584 --> 00:00:39,504
- What do you think?
- Drat.

13
00:00:41,088 --> 00:00:44,928
- Now, shall we get back to work?
- I suppose.

14
00:00:47,929 --> 00:00:49,809
(Sheldon:)Battlestar Galactica comes on tonight.

15
00:00:51,349 --> 00:00:52,849
(Sheldon:)I guess I can wait for the DVD.

16
00:00:54,727 --> 00:01:56,037
(Sheldon:)And then never, ever watch it.

